1
00:05:23,333 --> 00:05:29,333
First it takes hold of your mind...then it takes hold of your life.

2
00:10:46,666 --> 00:10:52,666
The Number 23 is a thriller, mystery, crime film directed by Joel Schumacher.

3
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:16,000
Animal control officer Walter Sparrow becomes obsessed with a novel that he believes was written about
him, as more and more similarities between himself and his literary alter ego seem to arise.

4
00:21:33,333 --> 00:21:39,333
Walter Sparrow / Fingerling, played by Jim Carrey.

5
00:26:56,666 --> 00:27:02,666
Agatha Sparrow / Fabrizia, played by Virginia Madsen.

6
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:26,000
Robin Sparrow, played by Logan Lerman.

7
00:37:43,333 --> 00:37:49,333
Isaac French / Dr. Miles Phoenix, played by Danny Huston.

8
00:43:06,666 --> 00:43:12,666
Suicide Blonde / Mrs. Dobkins / Young Fingerling's
Mother, played by Lynn Collins.

9
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Laura Tollins, played by Rhona Mitra.

10
00:53:53,333 --> 00:53:59,333
The Number 23 is a 2007 American psychological thriller film written
by Fernley Phillips and directed by Joel Schumacher.

11
00:59:16,666 --> 00:59:22,666
Jim Carrey stars as a man who becomes obsessed with the 23 enigma once he reads
about it in a strange book that seemingly mirrors his own life.

12
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
The film was released in the United States on
February 23, 2007 by New Line Cinema.

13
01:10:03,333 --> 01:10:09,333
This is the second film to pair Schumacher and
Carrey, the first being Batman Forever.

14
01:15:26,666 --> 01:15:32,666
The film was a financial success, grossing $77.6 million against a $30 million
budget, but received generally negative reviews from critics.

15
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:56,000
Despite this, Carrey was proud of the film, saying: "I was able to explore the darker edges
of my personality, which really was a blast and something different for me."

16
01:26:13,333 --> 01:26:19,333
The film explores themes of hotel room, suicide, based on
novel or book, obsession, sadomasochism.

17
01:31:36,666 --> 01:31:42,666
The tone is intense and mind_bending.
